0d0846c0bd7a9922d90968bc79", "message": "Bugfix: Re-sort final master frame according to ...\n\n... original master frame sort order (if it existed).", "created_at": "2023-07-18T12:04:27Z", "repo": "fframeappend", "file_sampled": false, "has_test_file": null, "has_impl_file": null}, {"sha": "9c00af4970e1062a98580e4d592f2efcb96ac42f", "message": "Update README.md", "created_at": "2023-07-18T12:04:01Z", "repo": "fframeappend", "file_sampled": false, "has_test_file": null, "has_impl_file": null}, {"sha": "28a9a1ebd0c29823fdb118c041da440ba98c912d", "message": "Fix typo and add clarifications to help file", "created_at": "2023-07-11T11:50:31Z", "repo": "fframeappend", "file_sampled": false, "has_test_file": null, "has_impl_file": null}, {"sha": "ec0698bb2edbed4dc51104127e8c333aa32b0f9e", "message": "New features:\n\n- Option `using` now takes a list of frames; wildcards allowed\n- Implemented `generate` option, similar to\n  `xframeappend`", "created_at": "2023-07-09T08:40:25Z", "repo": "fframeappend", "file_sampled": false, "has_test_file": null, "has_impl_file": null}, {"sha": "6e7d0eaee73a812d5b2510f7218f1189a6e1b4ca", "message": "Update Readme.md", "created_at": "2023-07-09T08:39:58Z", "repo": "fframeappend", "file_sampled": false, "has_test_file": null, "has_impl_file": null}, {"sha": "78be6f51a6272b96ac0b91f5ca39d3ab3325755d", "message": "Update Readme.md", "created_at": "2023-07-08T10:57:08Z", "repo": "fframeappend", "file_sampled": false, "has_test_file": null, "has_impl_file": null}, {"sha": "4d510647d67adbaf15ed5c7d23583554b5779880", "message": "Make package installable with `net install`", "created_at": "2023-07-08T09:58:18Z", "repo": "fframeappend", "file_sampled": false, "has_test_file": null, "has_impl_file": null}, {"sha": "fafa958fdb5e07af85bd68a344527e6460916ac3", "message": "Quieted noisy output", "created_at": "2023-02-28T12:07:47Z", "repo": "fframeappend", "file_sampled": false, "has_test_file": null, "has_impl_file": null}, {"sha": "62ea5b829824671fffc86f7b0a9fe6b0692b7764", "message": "Fixed type promotion behavior\n\nThe previous version didn't promote types of a variable in the master\nframe to the possibly \"larger\" type of the corresponding variable in\nthe using frame. This has been fixed.", "created_at": "2022-04-05T06:50:42Z", "repo": "fframeappend", "file_sampled": false, "has_test_file": null, "has_impl_file": null}, {"sha": "c98b6664e4d501c71554a3c6e03edadbaa0f6e82", "message": "Minor changes", "created_at": "2022-03-28T07:58:19Z", "repo": "fframeappend", "file_sampled": false, "has_test_file": null, "has_impl_file": null}, {"sha": "383e2dfac8a491df40c0e39da2302c2ca7520aba", "message": "Initial commit", "created_at": "2022-03-27T16:08:19Z", "repo": "fframeappend", "file_sampled": false, "has_test_file": null, "has_impl_file": null}], "prs": []}